    "Keyed by PHRASE, not by key: one phrase is typically identical across several",
    "namespaces, and listing it once is the difference between a reviewable file and a",
    "wall of 636 lines.",
    "",
    "terms        legitimately identical - the game's own vocabulary, which players say",
    "             in English. Permanent. Adding one is a judgement, so make it",
    "             deliberately.",
    "untranslated English on a Greek screen. DEBT. This list is allowed to shrink and",
    "             nothing else: translate the value and delete the phrase, in the same",
    "             commit.",
    "",
    "The initial split was generated by the vocabulary rule below and then STORED as",
    "explicit phrases rather than re-derived on every run. A rule quietly admits any",
    "new phrase built from words it already knows, and 'Team Builder Character Box",
    "Type' is not a sentence anybody should be shown. The vocabulary is kept here as a",
    "tool for the next person classifying a phrase, not as a substitute for doing it.",
    "",
    "Baseline measured 2026-09-15 against v0.4.48: 3,169 keys in 29 namespaces, 0",
    "placeholder mismatches."
